        "id": 131685,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-20T02:49:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's worth noting that different heroes care about their base power more than others.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fixer's playstyle is defined by his ability. &nbsp;Unity and Nightmist are also greatly affected by their powers. &nbsp;The Wraith, on the other hand, has so many excellent powers to choose from that she quickly stops using her base power and once she's fully set up she'll probably never use it again. &nbsp;Expat and Bunker are more like Wraith. &nbsp;They have so many powers that they'll quickly stop relying on their base power, unless it has particular utility. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:07:02.238Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
