        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pulseglazer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/f04885/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pulseglazer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That, to me, is the problem with the Expat promo. Neither it nor her base power are any use if you cant find a gun.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's not quite true. Double RPG Launcher is pretty good.</p>",
