        "created_at": "2015-02-20T22:12:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>RPG Launcher works on environment cards as well, don't forget ;). Also, it's not so much the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">number</span> of possible ongoings as what they <span class=\"bbcode-i\">do</span>. Stuff like Return with the Dawn, Backlash Field, Forced Deployment, Apocalypse…the ones where you go \"arrgh, not that one…\" for whatever reason.</p>",
